### LOGIN AN USER
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "email": "betsy@icloud.com",
   "password": "123456"
}

### GET AN USER (requires authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{userId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### LOGOUT AN USER 
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### UPDATE AN USER
PUT {{baseUrl}}/me HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "email": "betsy@icloud.com",
   "name": "Betsy",
   "surname": "Lima",
   "displayName": "KeoLima",
   "password": "123456",
   "city": "Lyon",
   "avatarUrl": null
}

### UPLOAD AVATAR
